[{"answer":"Remind me, Trevor, how long is the presentation?","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-7-test-4-part-3-2023-07-31-19-32-33/1.mp3"},{"answer":"Dr White said three per hour.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-7-test-4-part-3-2023-07-31-19-32-33/2.mp3"},{"answer":"So about twenty minutes?","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-7-test-4-part-3-2023-07-31-19-32-33/3.mp3"},{"answer":"Well... it'll be fifteen minutes per presentation.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-7-test-4-part-3-2023-07-31-19-32-33/4.mp3"},{"answer":"And five minutes for questions.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-7-test-4-part-3-2023-07-31-19-32-33/5.mp3"},{"answer":"And is this one going to be assessed?","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-7-test-4-part-3-2023-07-31-19-32-33/6.mp3"},{"answer":"No, not this time round","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-7-test-4-part-3-2023-07-31-19-32-33/7.mp3"},{"answer":"because it's the first one... you know.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-7-test-4-part-3-2023-07-31-19-32-33/8.mp3"},{"answer":"Oh, good news.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-7-test-4-part-3-2023-07-31-19-32-33/9.mp3"},{"answer":"Well, Trevor, what are we going to include?","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-7-test-4-part-3-2023-07-31-19-32-33/10.mp3"},{"answer":"Well, do you think we ought to give some historical background?","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-7-test-4-part-3-2023-07-31-19-32-33/11.mp3"},{"answer":"Oh no, definitely not, we won't have time!","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-7-test-4-part-3-2023-07-31-19-32-33/12.mp3"},{"answer":"OK...","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-7-test-4-part-3-2023-07-31-19-32-33/13.mp3"},{"answer":"but I think we ought to say something about the geographical location","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-7-test-4-part-3-2023-07-31-19-32-33/14.mp3"},{"answer":"cos not a lot of people know where the islands are.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-7-test-4-part-3-2023-07-31-19-32-33/15.mp3"},{"answer":"Yes, okay...","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-7-test-4-part-3-2023-07-31-19-32-33/16.mp3"},{"answer":"I'll take notes, shall I?","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-7-test-4-part-3-2023-07-31-19-32-33/17.mp3"},{"answer":"Yeah, that'll be a help.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-7-test-4-part-3-2023-07-31-19-32-33/18.mp3"},{"answer":"So, geographical location...","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-7-test-4-part-3-2023-07-31-19-32-33/19.mp3"},{"answer":"Then we ought to give an overview of the whole education system.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-7-test-4-part-3-2023-07-31-19-32-33/20.mp3"},{"answer":"Shouldn't we say something about the economy,","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-7-test-4-part-3-2023-07-31-19-32-33/21.mp3"},{"answer":"you know agricultural produce, minerals and so forth?","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-7-test-4-part-3-2023-07-31-19-32-33/22.mp3"},{"answer":"Well, Dr White said we shouldn't go into that sort of detail.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-7-test-4-part-3-2023-07-31-19-32-33/23.mp3"},{"answer":"But it's pretty important when you think about it,","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-7-test-4-part-3-2023-07-31-19-32-33/24.mp3"},{"answer":"you know, because it does influence the education system.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-7-test-4-part-3-2023-07-31-19-32-33/25.mp3"},{"answer":"Look, let's think about that one later shall we?","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-7-test-4-part-3-2023-07-31-19-32-33/26.mp3"},{"answer":"Let's see how we're doing for time.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-7-test-4-part-3-2023-07-31-19-32-33/27.mp3"},{"answer":"Okay, so... general overview of education.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-7-test-4-part-3-2023-07-31-19-32-33/28.mp3"},{"answer":"Of course... and then the role of English language.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-7-test-4-part-3-2023-07-31-19-32-33/29.mp3"},{"answer":"Hmm... Nope, that goes in the Language Policy Seminar, don't you remember?","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-7-test-4-part-3-2023-07-31-19-32-33/30.mp3"},{"answer":"Are you sure?","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-7-test-4-part-3-2023-07-31-19-32-33/31.mp3"},{"answer":"Positive.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-7-test-4-part-3-2023-07-31-19-32-33/32.mp3"},{"answer":"Alright.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-7-test-4-part-3-2023-07-31-19-32-33/33.mp3"},{"answer":"so those are the topics we're going to be... to be covering.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-7-test-4-part-3-2023-07-31-19-32-33/34.mp3"},{"answer":"We need to think about what to prepare...","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-7-test-4-part-3-2023-07-31-19-32-33/35.mp3"},{"answer":"Dr White said he wanted us to use plenty of visuals and things and...","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-7-test-4-part-3-2023-07-31-19-32-33/36.mp3"},{"answer":"we might as well try them out when we're not being assessed.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-7-test-4-part-3-2023-07-31-19-32-33/37.mp3"},{"answer":"Well, the most important thing is the overhead projector.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-7-test-4-part-3-2023-07-31-19-32-33/38.mp3"},{"answer":"No problem, we'll get that from the media room.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-7-test-4-part-3-2023-07-31-19-32-33/39.mp3"},{"answer":"Must remember to book it.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-7-test-4-part-3-2023-07-31-19-32-33/40.mp3"},{"answer":"Well... we'll need a map of course.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-7-test-4-part-3-2023-07-31-19-32-33/41.mp3"},{"answer":"Probably two... one of the islands... large scale.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-7-test-4-part-3-2023-07-31-19-32-33/42.mp3"},{"answer":"And one of West Africa.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-7-test-4-part-3-2023-07-31-19-32-33/43.mp3"},{"answer":"Well, the West African one is no problem.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-7-test-4-part-3-2023-07-31-19-32-33/44.mp3"},{"answer":"There's one in the Resources Room.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-7-test-4-part-3-2023-07-31-19-32-33/45.mp3"},{"answer":"Oh yeah, of course, the resources room;","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-7-test-4-part-3-2023-07-31-19-32-33/46.mp3"},{"answer":"the islands are going to be more of a problem.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-7-test-4-part-3-2023-07-31-19-32-33/47.mp3"},{"answer":"Tell you what, there's a very clear map of Santiago in that tourist brochure I showed you last week.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-7-test-4-part-3-2023-07-31-19-32-33/48.mp3"},{"answer":"Don't you remember it?","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-7-test-4-part-3-2023-07-31-19-32-33/49.mp3"},{"answer":"Oh yeah, that's right;","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-7-test-4-part-3-2023-07-31-19-32-33/50.mp3"},{"answer":"we can just use the tourist brochure.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-7-test-4-part-3-2023-07-31-19-32-33/51.mp3"},{"answer":"We also need statistics on several different things.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-7-test-4-part-3-2023-07-31-19-32-33/52.mp3"},{"answer":"Literacy rates.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-7-test-4-part-3-2023-07-31-19-32-33/53.mp3"},{"answer":"Yes, and school places.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-7-test-4-part-3-2023-07-31-19-32-33/54.mp3"},{"answer":"How about the encyclopedia?","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-7-test-4-part-3-2023-07-31-19-32-33/55.mp3"},{"answer":"Nah... not up-to-date enough!","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-7-test-4-part-3-2023-07-31-19-32-33/56.mp3"},{"answer":"Mmm... why don't we call the embassy?","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-7-test-4-part-3-2023-07-31-19-32-33/57.mp3"},{"answer":"Oh... someone's enthusiastic!","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-7-test-4-part-3-2023-07-31-19-32-33/58.mp3"},{"answer":"Well... if something's worth doing...","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-7-test-4-part-3-2023-07-31-19-32-33/59.mp3"},{"answer":"I know... it's worth doing well... okay.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-7-test-4-part-3-2023-07-31-19-32-33/60.mp3"},{"answer":"We can find out statistics on school places from them as well.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-7-test-4-part-3-2023-07-31-19-32-33/61.mp3"},{"answer":"Might as well.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-7-test-4-part-3-2023-07-31-19-32-33/62.mp3"},{"answer":"Look, Julie, it's almost time for our tutorials.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-7-test-4-part-3-2023-07-31-19-32-33/63.mp3"},{"answer":"We can meet again on Monday","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-7-test-4-part-3-2023-07-31-19-32-33/64.mp3"},{"answer":"but we need to prepare...","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-7-test-4-part-3-2023-07-31-19-32-33/65.mp3"}]
